Microsoft C/C++ runtime and Windows platform
------------------------------------------
The recorded CLI imports VCRUNTIME140.dll and requires the Microsoft v14 x64
Runtime separately. The desktop uses Tauri's static_vcruntime build support.
Static Microsoft runtime components retain Microsoft's applicable terms.
No standalone Microsoft runtime installer or runtime DLL is added as a Glyphibe
release asset. Windows system libraries remain platform dependencies.

Microsoft documents static linking as a deployment option. Runtime fixes then
require rebuilding and redistributing the application. This servicing guidance
does not amount to a general prohibition on static runtime linkage.

